From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:06:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1023/1024] SableOS: Photos keys follow the design's S, add Z,
 grid J/K and captions

MEDIA_GALLERY_UX gives S (with /) to search and the approved artifact
shows no share key, so S no longer shares. Glimpse has no search, so S
is left alone; share moves to E, the export key of the Files design.

* Viewer: E share, Z zoom mode (one step in when the photo fits, else
  back to fit), as the artifact's "[Z Zoom]".
* Grid: J / K previous / next item (artifact "[J/K Prev/Next]"), E
  share.
* VIEWER_CAPTION, GRID_CAPTION_KEYS and gridCaption(): the caption
  strips' text.

Pure Java; host tests in the SableOS Q25 repository
(tests/java/stock-apps/Glimpse). Wired up by the next patch.
---
 .../glimpse/sable/SableGalleryKeys.java       | 44 ++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 38 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/glimpse/sable/SableGalleryKeys.java b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/glimpse/sable/SableGalleryKeys.java
index ba6c673..bc67f24 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/glimpse/sable/SableGalleryKeys.java
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/glimpse/sable/SableGalleryKeys.java
@@ -11,11 +11,15 @@ package org.lineageos.glimpse.sable;
  *
  * <p>Viewer: Left/J previous, Right/K next, Space play/pause for a video and next for a photo
  * (Shift+Space previous), + and - zoom (on this keyboard Alt+O and Alt+I; = and the keypad keys
- * work too), 0 fits the photo again, I info, S share, F favorite, D or Del delete. Delete always
- * asks first. Back leaves the viewer as before.
+ * work too), Z zoom mode (one step in, or back to fit), 0 fits the photo again, I info, E share
+ * (export), F favorite, D or Del delete. Delete always asks first. Back leaves the viewer as
+ * before.
  *
- * <p>Grid: Enter opens the focused photo as before, Space opens it too, D or Del deletes the
- * focused photo (or the selection) after asking, S shares it.
+ * <p>Grid: Enter opens the focused photo as before, Space opens it too, J / K previous / next
+ * item, D or Del deletes the focused photo (or the selection) after asking, E shares it.
+ *
+ * <p>S is not Share: MEDIA_GALLERY_UX gives S (with /) to search, and Glimpse has no search, so S
+ * is left alone. Share moved to E, the export key of the Files design.
  *
  * <p>Ctrl and Meta chords are never ours. A held key only repeats moving and zooming.
  */
@@ -29,6 +33,8 @@ public final class SableGalleryKeys {
         ZOOM_IN,
         ZOOM_OUT,
         ZOOM_FIT,
+        /** Z: zoom one step in when the photo fits, else fit it again. */
+        ZOOM_TOGGLE,
